<div class="text guide-styles" data-zaf-dynamic="article" id="guide-body" lang="en">
<div class="markup-toc-wrapper">
<button class="markup-toc-button">Show Table of Contents</button></div>Welcome to Wowhead's Pre-Raid Best in Slot Gear List for Enhancement Shaman DPS in Cataclysm Classic Phase 4. Gear in this guide is primarily obtained from Twilight Protocol Dungeons and Valor Points. This guide will list the recommended gear for your class and role, containing gear sourced from dungeons, PvP, professions, Bind on Equip drops, and reputations.<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="best-in-slot">
<span class="c7">Best in Slot Gear for Enhancement Shaman DPS in Pre-Raid</span></h2>
<b>Note that <a class="icontiny" data-entity="race" data-game="wow" data-type="race" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/race=2/orc">
<img alt="Orc" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/race_orc_male.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Orc</span></a>s should reforge their helm into Mastery instead of Expertise to account for the <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=20574/axe-specialization">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_axe_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Axe Specialization</span></a> racial bonus when using the suggested gear set.</b>
<br/>
<br/>
