<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="valor-points">Valor Points for Enhancement Shaman DPS in Phase 4</h3>Normal mode tier tokens are no longer acquirable with <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> due to the introduction of LFR items on Dragon Soul, thus Valor can be more freely spent on gear such as <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77095/batwing-cloak">
<img alt="Batwing Cloak" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_deathwingraid_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Batwing Cloak</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77080/ripfang-relic">
<img alt="Ripfang Relic" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_scroll_15.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ripfang Relic</span></a>.<br/>
<br/>While none of the Valor gear is best in slot for Enhancement, it is close enough that it can help fill in gaps while you wait for the best in slot pieces to drop, or as an alternative to Firelands gear if using new characters.<br/>
<br/>
