<img alt="Dragonbelly Bracers" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_mail_raidhunter_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Dragonbelly Bracers</span></a>, with old <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71365/hide-bound-chains">
<img alt="Hide-Bound Chains" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_mail_raidhunter_j_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Hide-Bound Chains</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71264/bracers-of-forked-lightning">
