<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="relics-for-enhancement-shaman-dps">Relics for Enhancement Shaman DPS</h4>Relics are very straightforward in Cataclysm, they are just stat sticks that are universal across Paladin/<wbr/>Druid/<wbr/>Shaman.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71567/covenant-of-the-flame">
<img alt="Covenant of the Flame" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_scroll_15.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Covenant of the Flame</span></a> is still the best option, with the new Valor relic, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77080/ripfang-relic">
<img alt="Ripfang Relic" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_scroll_15.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ripfang Relic</span></a>, having slightly worse stats.<div class="pad"></div>
<div class="markup-table-wrapper">
<table class="grid max-width">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td data-background="c7" style="width: 10%; max-width: 100%;">
<b>Rank</b></td>
<td data-background="c7" style="width: 25%; max-width: 100%;">
<b>Item</b></td>
<td data-background="c7" style="width: 20%; max-width: 100%;">
<b>Sockets</b></td>
